per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (6/10).","financial_summary":["Galaxy Digital Inc. is a mid-cap financial services business with a $6.6B market cap on $60.4B of annual revenue.","Returns on capital run at -44254% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $1.5B of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -3.6\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 13.0% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 2.4% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Very elevated short interest (19.8% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 29% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Widening credit spreads suggest growing stress in corporate debt markets","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Broad market in a downtrend, trading below its 200-day average","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Multiple macro indicators signal economic contraction","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 98% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Insiders are net buyers (79% buy ratio) \u2014 insiders sell for many reasons but buy for only one","Large open-market insider purchases (net $14.9M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Reviewing Galaxy Digital (NASDAQ:GLXY) & Forge Global (NYSE:FRGE)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/reviewing-galaxy-digital-nasdaqglxy-forge-global-nysefrge.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795183144.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.909,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Galaxy Digital (NASDAQ:GLXY) Upgraded at Wall Street Zen","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/17/galaxy-digital-nasdaqglxy-upgraded-at-wall-street-zen.html","date":"2026-11-17","timestamp":1794909576.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.844,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Can Galaxy Digital (NASDAQ:GLXY) Turn Data Centers Into A Growth Engine?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/financial/can-galaxy-digital-nasdaqglxy-turn-data-centers-into-a-growth-engine","date":"2026-11-16","timestamp":1794846000.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.896,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"What Could Galaxy Digital (GLXY) Gain From A Natio